    {
      "field_name": "diagnostic_criteria",
      "value": "clinical picture (lower back pain, walking difficulty, severe abdominal and lower lumbar muscle spasms, elevated serum creatinine kinase), very high levels of GADA in serum and CSF, normal brain and spinal cord MRI, normal CSF leukocyte count/protein/IgG index but elevated total IgG and oligoclonal bands, normal ENMG, exclusion of mimics (negative viral/Mycoplasma/Borrelia antibodies)",
